BUTADIENE","pounds":18.6,"facility_id":"110000461134","distance_km":1.6,"bearing_deg":325.8,"in_corridor":false,"resolution":"outside the corridor (1.6 km, 45° off the wind)"},{"incident":"450581","entity":"Pasadena Performance Products","rn":"RN101997104","start_local":"2025-12-17T20:08","compound":"Butane, N-","pounds":149.432,"facility_id":"110005028120","distance_km":8.9,"bearing_deg":62.6,"in_corridor":true,"resolution":"in the upwind corridor"}],"search_scope":"Searched every STEERS emissions event starting 12/18/2025 in Harris County (0 found; search complete). Also searched reports that started in the 30 days before and were still running (2 open that day; earlier search incomplete). The match window runs past midnight, so reports that started 12/19/2025 by 01:00 local were also searched (0 found; search complete).","status":"reported_mismatch","incident":"450581","matched_facility_id":"110005028120","source_url":"https://www2.tceq.texas.gov/oce/eer/index.cfm?fuseaction=main.getDetails&target=450581","checks":[{"at":"T+24h","status":"reported","note":"initial notice filed 2025-12-18T12:43 local, 16.6 h after the reported discovery 2025-12-17T20:08"},{"at":"T+14d","status":"reported","note":"final report dated 2026-01-05, 13 days after the event ended"}],"compound_match":false,"reported":{"facility":"Pasadena Performance Products","compound":"Butane, N-","pounds":149.432,"start_local":"2025-12-17T20:08","end_local":"2025-12-23T13:00","tz":"local (CST)","cause":"Loss of all catalyst to the dimer unit caused a process unit upset","match_basis":"ongoing (started 2025-12-17)","travel_h":0.53,"travel_speed_mph":10.4,"travel_distance_km":8.9,"start_to_spike_h":26.87,"arrival_local":"2025-12-17T20:39","spike_hour_local":["2025-12-18T23:00","2025-12-19T00:00"]}},"corridor":{"origin_site_id":"48_201_6000","half_width_deg":22.5,"max_km":15.0,"wind_from_deg":[69.0,11.0]},"packet":{"draft_en":"On December 18, 2025, the Texas state monitor at Cesar Chavez recorded 21.73 ppb of 1,3-butadiene in the 11:00 p.m. CST hour, against a 7-day median of 0.06 ppb. Wind there came from 11 degrees at 10.4 mph. 41 major permitted facilities lie in the upwind corridor. One of them, Pasadena Performance Products, filed report 450581 for a release that started 2025-12-17 and, per the report, ran until 2025-12-23 13:00 local time, but the report does not list 1,3-butadiene, so it does not match this reading. Requested follow-up: confirm what caused this 1,3-butadiene reading.","draft_es":"El 18 de diciembre de 2025, el monitor estatal de Texas en Cesar Chavez registró 21.73 ppb de 1,3-butadieno en la hora de las 11:00 p. m. CST, frente a una mediana de 7 días de 0.06 ppb. El viento venía de 11 grados a 10.4 mph. Hay 41 instalaciones permitidas importantes en el corredor de donde venía el viento. Una de ellas, Pasadena Performance Products, presentó el informe 450581 por una emisión que empezó el 2025-12-17 y que, según el informe, siguió hasta el 2025-12-23 13:00, hora local, pero el informe no incluye 1,3-butadieno, así que no corresponde a esta lectura. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar qué causó esta lectura de 1,3-butadieno.","drafted_by":"template (deterministic, no AI)","guard":{"passed":true,"rejected":[]}},"cannot_say":["A matching report is not proof the facility caused every reading; other sources can add to a spike.","'Not yet reported' is not a finding about any facility: Texas requires a report only at or above a reportable quantity, and air readings cannot measure how much was released (30 TAC 101.201).","The upwind corridor comes from wind direction at one monitor (geometry only), not a dispersion model; it cannot tell facilities along the same bearing apart.","Facility coordinates are as published by EPA ECHO and may be approximate.","Only regulator-grade monitors whose data the state publishes are used (including two industry-funded Houston Regional Monitoring sites), never low-cost sensors."],"provenance":[{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_0307_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_0307","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88649,"sha256":"0a17f200bfc5578973f8861ebafc67558bbe6d4e401f1cf1925822be0bbdbec1","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:59:11+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_1614_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_1614","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88640,"sha256":"0858a2973f577f16c2fcff11072db76b49e786cf45867e7b19d6b47a8317a2bf","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T23:59:56+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_1035_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_1035","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":87784,"sha256":"1e1b91b311d6bd4e9adbe062226ae5c23f58c03b9a5430e328ba068039e830aa","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T00:00:19+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_1015_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_1015","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":87884,"sha256":"36389c0bd9414de7ad36ea7235ab7491a01c2be0ead06ba482e20f1eec5a8c10","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T00:00:42+00:00"},{"file":"backtest/agc_2025_48_201_0803_43218.html","url":"https://www.tceq.texas.gov/cgi-bin/compliance/monops/agc_yearly_summary.pl","params":{"user_year":"2025","user_site":"48_201_0803","user_param":"43218","user_units":"ppb-v","report_format":"comma","user_decimals":"2"},"bytes":88564,"sha256":"0f0dfb1c779beda7f44374a616f6d4100564d412abac316593ea2a5da5fec034","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T00: